{
  "about": "Six Hebrew font families under the SIL Open Font License 1.1, taken unmodified from the Google Fonts repository (github.com/google/fonts, folder ofl/<dir>). Only the file names were changed, to names with no brackets. Each folder holds the family's own OFL.txt.",
